# Patterns without a glob only match at the repo root. The ** prefix is what
# keeps nested copies out — a copied apps/*/node_modules overwrites the symlinks
# pnpm created inside the image and breaks the build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

.git
.github
